==Miscellaneous==

*BGM and Sound Effects can now be toggled into 5 levels of volume.
*[[Catfruit]] stages can now be played on the weekends.
*[[Cat Capsule|Cat Storage]] has been upgraded to max capacity of 128 units.
*Fixed an issue in which the sound effect of the [[Cat Cannon]] going off would play when returning to the [[Cat Base]].
*Fixed a display bug in which the time displayed was inaccurate for certain guerrilla stages.
*Fixed an issue in which [[Steel Visage (Deadly)|Facing Danger]] would not appear.

